          ],
          "lesson": [
            {
              "temp=": "practice"
            },
            "^Good news first: five letters look and sound almost like English. А, К, М, О, Т.",
            "\n",
            "^«Мама» is mum, «кіт» is cat. Try reading this one. ",
            "#",
            "^quiz:alpha_easy_1",
            "/#",
            "\n",
            "ev",
            {
              "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
            },
            "/ev",
            [
              {
                "->": ".^.b",
                "c": true
              },
              {
                "b": [
                  "\n",
                  "^Perfect!",
                  "\n",
                  "ev",
                  {
                    "VAR?": "practice"
                  },
                  "!",
                  "/ev",
                  [
                    {
                      "->": ".^.b",
                      "c": true
                    },
                    {
                      "b": [
                        "\n",
                        "ev",
                        {
                          "VAR?": "alpha_score"
                        },
                        1,
                        "+",
                        {
                          "VAR=": "alpha_score",
                          "re": true
                        },
                        "/ev",
                        {
                          "->": ".^.^.^.8"
                        },
                        null
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "nop",
                  "\n",
                  {
                    "->": "lesson.13"
                  },
                  null
                ]
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "->": ".^.b"
              },
              {
                "b": [
                  "\n",
                  "^It's «мама», mama. М is m, А is a.",
                  "\n",
                  {
                    "->": "lesson.13"
                  },
                  null
                ]
              }
            ],
            "nop",
            "\n",
            "^Now the tricky ones. They look English, but they lie. В is v, Н is n, Р is r, С is s.",
            "\n",
            "^У is oo, Х is kh, Е is e as in \"met\", І is ee.",
            "\n",
            "^So how does «Р» sound? ",
            "#",
            "^quiz:alpha_false_1",
            "/#",
            "\n",
            "ev",
            {
              "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
            },
            "/ev",
            [
              {
                "->": ".^.b",
                "c": true
              },
              {
                "b": [
                  "\n",
                  "^Yes, r! Not p.",
                  "\n",
                  "ev",
                  {
                    "VAR?": "practice"
                  },
                  "!",
                  "/ev",
                  [
                    {
                      "->": ".^.b",
                      "c": true
                    },
                    {
                      "b": [
